@startuml AD_CompareWhatIfScenarios
title UC-W05 - Compare Completed What-if Scenarios

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam conditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ArrowColor #42566B
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F0F6FB
  BorderColor #42566B
  FontColor #172B4D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4D6
  DiamondBorderColor #A67C23
  StartColor #253E55
  EndColor #253E55
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #9AAABA
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2EBF3
  TitleFontColor #172B4D
}

|Operator|
start
:Open scenario comparison;
:Select two completed runs
or one run and its baseline;

|System / Controller|
:Validate selection and permission;

|Database|
:Retrieve results, metric schemas,
snapshots, assumptions and horizons;

|System / Controller|
if (Records available and completed?) then (yes)
  :Find common metric
  definitions and units;
  if (Meaningful common measures?) then (yes)
    fork
      :Compare service capacity
      and unserved demand;
    fork again
      :Compare parking utilization
      and vehicle availability;
    fork again
      :Compare charging congestion,
      delay and projected revenue;
    end fork
    :Detect snapshot, freshness,
    assumption and horizon differences;
    :Calculate deltas only for
    compatible measures;
    :Display side-by-side values,
    baseline context and warnings;
    |Operator|
    :Review comparison
    and limitations;
  else (no)
    :Explain incompatible
    measure definitions;
    :Do not produce a
    misleading ranking;
    |Operator|
    :Choose other completed
    runs or exit;
  endif
else (no)
  :Identify missing, failed
  or running record;
  |Operator|
  :Choose other completed
  runs or exit;
endif
stop

note right
Comparison is read-only and preserves each run's original context.
end note
@enduml
